groovebox-scene 1
# A drop of the folder kit/ on STEP: kick.wav at 96 kHz in 32-bit float, mono, pad.wav at 44.1 kHz
# in 24 bits, stereo, and zap.wav in the nested folder fx/, handed over in the browser's order.
drop 3200 kit/fx/zap.wav sine 3000 0.05 48000 16 1
drop 3200 kit/kick.wav sine 60 0.3 96000 32f 1
drop 3200 kit/pad.wav sine 220 1 44100 24 2
input 3200 dropped 3
# "Importing 3 files" in the accent while it runs, then "3 files imported".
frame 4864
frame 11264
# A second drop into kit/: KICK.wav with other audio replaces kick.wav, kick.wav with the first
# audio then replaces KICK.wav, and the 8-bit lofi.wav can't be read.
drop 12800 kit/KICK.wav sine 80 0.3 96000 32f 1
drop 12800 kit/kick.wav sine 60 0.3 96000 32f 1
drop 12800 kit/lofi.wav base64 UklGRigAAABXQVZFZm10IBAAAAABAAEAQB8AAEAfAAABAAgAZGF0YQQAAACAwIBA
input 12800 dropped 3
# "Importing 3 files", then "2 files imported, 1 not: can't be read" in red.
frame 14464
frame 19200
# MENU + step 10 and OK show kit/: fx/, kick.wav and pad.wav.
input 20800 press menu
input 22400 press step-10
input 24000 release step-10
input 25600 release menu
input 27200 press ok
input 28800 release ok
frame 30464
end 32000
